---
// EarlifyWorkflow.astro - Continuidad Asistencial en 4 Etapas
---

<section id="de-la-consulta-a-la-casa" class="earlify-workflow section-padding" aria-labelledby="workflow-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-badge">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"></polyline></svg>
        <span>CONTINUIDAD ASISTENCIAL &amp; EDUCATIVA</span>
      </div>
      <h2 id="workflow-title" class="section-title">
        De la consulta médica al <span class="gradient-text">aula y a la vida cotidiana</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-description">
        Nuestras cuatro soluciones articulan un camino coordinado para que la evaluación no termine al salir de la consulta médica, el aula mantenga la accesibilidad acústica y la intervención en casa cuente con rigor clínico.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="workflow-grid">
      <!-- Paso 1: Evaluación Médica (VIA+) -->
      <article class="flow-card glass-card">
        <div class="flow-step">1</div>
        <div class="flow-header">
          <div class="flow-icon-wrap icon-cyan">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>VIA+</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="flow-role">1. Evaluación Médica Objetiva</p>
        <p class="flow-text">
          Valoración en consulta mediante tablet pediátrica con 13 módulos clínicos objetivos (otoscopia CAP, audiometría tonal y CRA, foniatría Praat C++, disfagia MECV-V e hitos ASHA). Cero cajas negras y Cero IA en runtime.
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- Conector 1 -->
      <div class="flow-connector" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
        <span class="connector-label">Criterio</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Paso 2: Aula Escolar (Descubre con Lúa) -->
      <article class="flow-card glass-card">
        <div class="flow-step">2</div>
        <div class="flow-header">
          <div class="flow-icon-wrap icon-emerald">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"></path><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Descubre</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="flow-role">2. Inclusión en el Aula</p>
        <p class="flow-text">
          Rutinas de asamblea infantil con metrónomo visual silencioso para menores con implante o audífono. 10 unidades de aula con 1.020 locuciones offline y cero exposición a pantallas directas para el menor.
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- Conector 2 -->
      <div class="flow-connector" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
        <span class="connector-label">Puente</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Paso 3: Rehabilitación Diaria (Valeria+) -->
      <article class="flow-card glass-card">
        <div class="flow-step">3</div>
        <div class="flow-header">
          <div class="flow-icon-wrap icon-purple">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Valeria+</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="flow-role">3. Rehabilitación en Familia</p>
        <p class="flow-text">
          Terapia adaptativa TPR en 10 bloques 100% offline y capacitación para padres en 2 minutos (Academy ASHA y LSE). El adulto evalúa cada respuesta ejerciendo el control clínico final.
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- Conector 3 -->
      <div class="flow-connector" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
        <span class="connector-label">Vínculo</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Paso 4: Hardware y Mediación (Lúa) -->
      <article class="flow-card glass-card">
        <div class="flow-step">4</div>
        <div class="flow-header">
          <div class="flow-icon-wrap icon-amber">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"></rect></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Lúa</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="flow-role">4. Mediación Afectiva</p>
        <p class="flow-text">
          Mascota física en ESP32-C3 con pantalla IPS circular GC9A01. Silencio clínico en consulta (SAFE 1), sin micrófonos por diseño y descanso visual activo 20-20-20.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <!-- Cierre Canónico de Propuesta de Valor y Filosofía Oficial -->
    <div class="canonical-closure-box glass-card">
      <div class="closure-badge">PROPUESTA DE VALOR CANÓNICA</div>
      <div class="closure-tagline">“Un mismo criterio. Mejor continuidad.”</div>
      <h3 class="closure-title">
        “Evaluamos, formamos, certificamos y rehabilitamos. Hacemos el trabajo completo.”
      </h3>
      <p class="closure-subtext">
        Earlify no sustituye el juicio profesional ni el de la familia. Lo ordena y le da continuidad para que ningún niño se quede atrás ante el neurodesarrollo infantil.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .earlify-workflow {
    position: relative;
    padding: clamp(70px, 10vw, 115px) 0;
    background-color: var(--bg-dark, #07090e);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto 3.5rem auto;
  }

  .section-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.25);
    color: #00f2fe;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-main, #f8fafc);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .gradient-text {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00f2fe 0%, #a855f7 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .section-description {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.15rem);
    color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Workflow Grid */
  .workflow-grid {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .flow-card {
    position: relative;
    flex: 1;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .flow-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .flow-step {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.25rem;
    right: 1.25rem;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8);
  }

  .flow-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .flow-icon-wrap {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .icon-cyan { background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.12); color: #00f2fe; }
  .icon-emerald { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12); color: #34d399; }
  .icon-purple { background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12); color: #c084fc; }
  .icon-amber { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12); color: #fbbf24; }

  .flow-header h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main, #f8fafc);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .flow-role {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .flow-text {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary, #cbd5e1);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .flow-connector {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    color: var(--text-muted, #64748b);
    padding: 0 0.25rem;
  }

  .connector-label {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  /* Canonical Closure Box */
  .canonical-closure-box {
    padding: 2.5rem 3rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1) 0%, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 920px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  }

  .closure-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35);
    color: #c084fc;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .closure-tagline {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #00f2fe;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .closure-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.5vw, 1.85rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main, #f8fafc);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .closure-subtext {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary, #cbd5e1);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .workflow-grid {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .flow-connector {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      padding: 0.5rem 0;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .canonical-closure-box {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
